    "enUS": {
      "description": "I haven't seen a {race} like you in years!\r\n\r\nOh, I don't know what to do! My friend Fraxinus is sick, and I can't leave him alone!\r\n\r\nCould you please fetch me some Untainted Soil from the uncorrupted land southeast of here? I can make some poultices that may help him to feel better.",
